<http://www.limics.fr/ontologies/ontolurgences#Syndrome> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.limics.fr/ontologies/ontolurgences#Syndrome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "syndrome" .
<http://www.limics.fr/ontologies/ontolurgences#Syndrome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.limics.fr/ontologies/ontolurgences#Signe> .
